From cd1ae91a340b8ffd95249ee86f8d4351b6d93db1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 20:06:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Viral toolkit: hook writer, platform pack, topic templates
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Three compilers that turn one idea into platform-ready marketing content:

1. Hook writer (POST /ai/generate-hooks, free like suggest-topics): 5
   first-three-seconds openers in distinct proven patterns — question,
   bold claim, contrarian, curiosity gap, stat, story — brand-voice-aware.
   In the video studio, "Hook ideas" next to the topic input; picking one
   steers the script to open with it.

2. Platform pack (POST /ai/platform-pack, funded as ONE caption:
   quota → credit → 402, refund on failure): one brief in, a natively
   rewritten caption + hashtags + CTA out for each platform
   (instagram/facebook/linkedin/x/threads/youtube), each respecting its
   platform's norms (X's 280 chars all-in, LinkedIn's max-3-hashtags,
   Threads' 500-char casual register...). Reuses the existing RICE prompt
   builder, humanization constraints, brand-kit rules, and taste memory.
   One-click copy per platform in the caption studio.

3. Topic templates: 8 proven short-form formats (listicle, myth-busting,
   before/after, insider secrets, ...) pre-fill the topic input from a
   "Start from a template" picker.

Verified: 5 new route tests green (hook parsing, platform filtering +
usage row, 402 on exhausted funding, credit refund on model failure),
14 studio page tests (hook apply flow), root typecheck, spec lint,
codegen committed. No schema change, no new dependencies.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
